WEBVTT

NOTE English translation of the existing Japanese guide slideshow.
Timing follows scripts/build-videos.py at 24 fps (62 frames per guide slide, six guide screens).

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Hands-free capture with Siri and AirPods.
Japanese in-app guide screenshots.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.583
From AirPods to your inbox and Obsidian.

00:00:05.583 --> 00:00:08.167
First, summon Siri.
“Hey Siri” is the reliable way; the stem press depends on your model.

00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:10.750
Japanese phrase: “シンプルメモで残す”
Once Siri answers, just say it.

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:13.333
Answer “What would you like to note?”
Your words become the note text.

00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:15.917
The screen shows earlier wording.
Email and the vault arrive by separate paths.

00:00:15.917 --> 00:00:18.500
Check email verification, Obsidian setup,
and the SimpleMemo Siri shortcut.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.500
The recommended phrase shown is Japanese.
The stem press depends on model and settings.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:23.917
Leave it by voice, without opening the app.
